* Java, Python, or R;
* SAS or SQL programming languages;
* Hadoop and Hive;
* MicroStrategy or Tableau;
* Spark, PySpark, or Scala;
* Traditional relational data warehouse technologies: Oracle, Teradata, or DB2;
* Infrastructure components: GPU’s or CPU’s;
* Designing data models and solutions for analytical and reporting use cases; and
* Providing domain support for healthcare or retail pharmacy organization. Pay Range: $135907\.00/year to $144200\.00/year.


